D.Towing rotation list participants must:
1.Immediately contact the chief of police, or his or her designee, when a participant
becomes aware that they will be unavailable for any reason, including, but not limited to,
planned medical treatment, vacation, etc., so arrangements can be made for coverage for such
time period and disruption of operations is avoided.In the event that the towing rotation list
participant is unavailable, the participant shall rotate to the bottom of the rotation list.
2. Respond to tow abandoned vehicles when requested. Refusal to respond to an
abandoned vehicle tow will be considered as a turn on the rotation list, and said participants shall
