4.Receive clearance by the police department prior to releasing any vehicle that has
been classified as a“Police Hold."
5.Assume full fiscal responsibility for all property and/or motor vehicles entrusted
to them.
6.Refrain from releasing, within ten (10) hours of time of towing, any vehicle towed
or recovered in connection with an incident involving driving under the influence of
alcoholic/malt beverages or drugs to the individual who was driving said vehicle at the time of
the violation.
